OL,3,GNEWSACCTV footage released in murder
OL,4,Ainvestigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice investigating the murder of a
OL,7,F73-year-old man have released CCTV
OL,8,Ffootage of a man they want to speak to
OL,9,Fin connection with the case.
OL,11,FDavid Morgan was found at his home in
OL,12,FBrook Street, Raunds in
OL,13,FNorthamptonshire on 8 October 2025.
OL,15,FDetectives arrested six people - three
OL,16,Fmen aged 52, 46 and 42, and three women
OL,17,Faged 42, 42 and 38 - in connection with
OL,18,Fthe incident. All six have been
OL,19,Freleased on police bail.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
